    {
      "object_id": "mathia_interpretation_2f46c402bc3aba5da0528b7cb3a3e5a51923174707075b842f05f3fb2a1e32a0",
      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The review attributes to this route an energy-dependent scattering kernel, a quasiperiodic potential, and finite positive thermodynamic quantities in a stated strip. It also says the proposed RH conclusion depends on assuming that interaction necessarily changes a leading thermodynamic contribution, so the route is not a proof. The artifact's sentence describing what an off-line zero does to that contribution is internally inconsistent with the alleged contradiction; its exact implication direction cannot be recovered safely from this text.",
